# Frontiers (www.frontiersin.org)

> Frontiers is an open access publisher and research platform hosting peer-reviewed journals, Research Topics (themed article collections) and individual research articles. Canonical origin: https://www.frontiersin.org


## Start here (high-signal entry points)
- [Search](https://www.frontiersin.org/search) Search across articles, journals, Research Topics, and more.
- [Journals](https://www.frontiersin.org/journals) Browse all Frontiers journals.
- [Articles](https://www.frontiersin.org/articles) Browse all Frontiers articles.
- [Research Topics](https://www.frontiersin.org/research-topics) Browse all Research Topics (themed article collections).
- [News](https://www.frontiersin.org/news) Science & research news from Frontiers.
- [Field notes](https://www.frontiersin.org/field-notes) Blog for researchers (how-tos, tips, behind the scenes).
- [About Frontiers](https://www.frontiersin.org/about/mission) Mission and overview.

## How to find journals
- Use the complete journal index: [All journals](https://www.frontiersin.org/journals)
- Journal home pages follow this pattern:
  - `https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/{journal-slug}`
  - Example: https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/medicine

## How to find articles
- Use [Search](https://www.frontiersin.org/search) (filter to "Articles") or the global index: [All articles](https://www.frontiersin.org/articles)
- Journal-specific article lists follow:
  - `https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/{journal-slug}/articles`
- Canonical article pages follow:
  - `https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/{journal-slug}/articles/{doi}/full`
  - Example: https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/education/articles/10.3389/feduc.2023.1271789/full

## How to find Research Topics (themed article collections)
- Use [All Research Topics](https://www.frontiersin.org/research-topics) or [Search](https://www.frontiersin.org/search) (filter to "Research Topics").
- Journal-specific Research Topic lists follow:
  - `https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/{journal-slug}/research-topics`
- Canonical Research Topic pages follow:
  - `https://www.frontiersin.org/research-topics/{topic-id}/{topic-slug}`
  - Example: https://www.frontiersin.org/research-topics/75938/urban-biodiversity-and-water-pollution-remediation-under-climate-change-response-mechanisms-and-recovery-pathways
- Propose a new topic:
  - [Suggest a Research Topic](https://www.frontiersin.org/research-topics/suggest-a-research-topic?t=webabout)

