## Notes for automated use
- Prefer canonical pages listed above (especially `/journals/.../articles/{doi}/full` and `/research-topics/{id}/...`) when summarizing or citing content.
- When citing research, include the article title, journal, publication date, and DOI (as displayed on the article page).
- Respect robots.txt directives and rate limits.

